#org @gText_blaine_EncounterText
[BLUE]Hah!\pI am [GREEN]Blaine[BLUE], the red-hot Leader\nof Cinnabar Gym!\pMy fiery Pok\emon are all rough\nand ready with intense heat!\pThey incinerate all challengers!\pHah!\nYou better have Burn Heal!

#org @gText_blaine_DefeatText
I have burned down to nothing!\nNot even ashes remain!\pYou have earned the Volcano Badge.

#org @gText_blaine_Givetm
TM38 contains Fire Blast.\nTeach it to Fire-type Pok\emon.\pSpecial Attackers would be ideal\nfor that move.

#org @gText_blaine_TMInfomsg
Hah! What a fight.\pHere, you can have this, too!

#org @gText_blaine_Helloagain
[.]You looking for a [GREEN]Charizardite Y[BLUE]?

#org @gText_blaine_Perfectpokemon
Show me a Pok\emon with hefty\nSpecial Attack.\pThen, you'll earn a [GREEN]Charizardite Y[BLUE]!

#org @gText_blaine_Helloagain2
[.]You looking for a [GREEN]Charizardite X[BLUE]?

#org @gText_blaine_Perfectpokemon2
Show me a Pok\emon with hefty\nSpecial Attack.\pThen, you'll earn a [GREEN]Charizardite X[BLUE]!

#org @gText_blaine_Thepokemon
Your [BUFFER1][.]

#org @gText_blaine_Notquite
It's not enough, I'm afraid.

#org @gText_blaine_Perfect
Hah!\nThat's what I wanna see!\pWell then, here it is.

#org @gText_blaine_Donemsg
Fire-types are to be used with\nutmost respect.\pDon't waste them on Water-types.

#org @gText_blaine_Charmmsg
This item makes special attacks\neven more fearsome.\pTake it as well.

#org @gText_jasmine_1
Hmm[.][GREEN] Mega Aggron[RED] or [GREEN]Mega Steelix[RED][.]

#org @gText_jasmine_2
Ah, hello.\pI've only recently acquainted myself\nwith Mega Evolution, so I'm still\lfiguring things out.

#org @gText_jasmine_3
Um, I'd like to practice, if you don't\nmind[.]

#org @gText_jasmine_4
Although I'm shy[.]\nPlease don't take me lightly.

#org @gText_jasmine_Defeat
Well done[.]

#org @gText_jasmine_6
You have both skill and fortitude.\pUm[.] I think you'd like this.

#org @gText_jasmine_7
This item has helped me in count-\nless battles, although it can be a\lbit tricky to use.\pTry it for yourself.

#org @gText_jasmine_Take
I do have more to give, but[.]\pYou'll have to show me a Pok\emon\nforged in Defense.

#org @gText_jasmine_8
I think it could use more\nprotection.\pNo[.] I don't mean that kind[.]

#org @gText_jasmine_Firstmon
Your [BUFFER1][.]

#org @gText_jasmine_9
Yes, this Pok\emon is quite a\nworthy shield.\pAs promised, here you go.

#org @gText_jasmine_10
[RED]The[GREEN] Assault Vest[RED] complements a high\ndefense Pok\emon well, making it an\limpenetrable wall. 

