#org @gText_therianforms_2
I have items that are said to change\nforms of certain Pok\emon.

#org @gText_therianforms_2_1
I already gave you the item\nfor that Pok\emon.

#org @gText_therianforms_3
If you show me one that's compatible,\nI'll gladly hand it over!

#org @gText_therianforms_5
That ain't it.

#org @gText_therianforms_7
Yes, that's it!\nHere you go! 

#org @gText_therianforms_4
[BUFFER1][.]

#org @gText_therianforms_8
I hope you're wreaking havoc\nwith the alternate forms. 

#org @gText_Cinnabar_Eevee
[GREEN]Eevee[BLUE] can evolve into one of eight\nkinds of Pok\emon. 

#org @gText_jasminere_1
[RED]Ah, welcome back.\nI hope you haven't returned\lhoping to destroy me in battle again.\pI've polished and learned a few new\nskills of my own.\pSo, is that what you'd like? 

#org @gText_jasminere_2
[RED]Hm, another loss, although it hurts\nless knowing you're the champion.\pI do feel like my battling prowess\nhas improved, so thank you.\pThis may assist you.

#org @gText_jasminere_3
[RED]And, if you'd like me to teach the move\nSteel Beam, talk to me!\pKeep it going, [GREEN][PLAYER].

#org @gText_CinnabarGym_AceTrainer1_1
I know why [GREEN]Blaine[BLUE] became a\nTrainer.

#org @gText_CinnabarGym_AceTrainer1_2
Ow!

#org @gText_CinnabarGym_AceTrainer1_3
Our Leader, [GREEN]Blaine[BLUE], became lost\nin the mountains but good.\pNight fell when a fiery bird\nPok\emon appeared.\pIts light allowed Blaine to find\nhis way down safely.

#org @gText_CinnabarGym_AceTrainer2_1
I've been to many Gyms, but this\none best suits my style.

#org @gText_CinnabarGym_AceTrainer2_2
Yowza!\nToo hot!

#org @gText_CinnabarGym_AceTrainer2_3
[GREEN]Blaziken, Cinderace[.]\n[RED]Those are popular Fire Pok\emon.

#org @gText_CinnabarGym_AceTrainer3_1
Fire is weak against H2O.

#org @gText_CinnabarGym_AceTrainer3_2
Oh!\nSnuffed out!

#org @gText_CinnabarGym_AceTrainer3_3
Water beats fire, of course.\pBut fire melts ice, so the Fire\ntype beats Ice-type Pok\emon.
